                    <item>Sir Edward Thornton to Mr. Fish, May 13, 1876.</item>
                    <item>Mr. Fish to Sir Edward Thornton, May 17, 1876.</item>
                    <item>Sir Edward Thornton to Mr. Fish, May 23, 1876.</item>
